  63:Core/Src/ad9518.c ****         {
  64:Core/Src/ad9518.c ****             /*
  65:Core/Src/ad9518.c ****              * Sample while SCLK is still low, before driving the clock.
  66:Core/Src/ad9518.c ****              *
  67:Core/Src/ad9518.c ****              * The part presents each bit on the falling edge, so the bit is
  68:Core/Src/ad9518.c ****              * already valid here. Sampling before the pulse also means the
  69:Core/Src/ad9518.c ****              * last bit is captured while the part is still driving it -
  70:Core/Src/ad9518.c ****              * sampling after the eighth rising edge can land in the window
  71:Core/Src/ad9518.c ****              * where the part has released SDIO, which a bus pull-up then
  72:Core/Src/ad9518.c ****              * reads back as a phantom 1 in bit 0.
